1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,151
One caution, and it ties back to Unit 3.

2
00:00:03,151 --> 00:00:08,867
Negative delta G means a reaction can happen, not that it happens quickly.

3
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:20,091
Diamond to graphite has delta G of minus two point nine kilojoules per mole, yet a diamond lasts for ever, because its activation energy is enormous.

